ype-Polyester-Anti-static-Needle-Felt-\u8be6\u60c55.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-3179\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/Blending-Type-Polyester-Anti-static-Needle-Felt-\u8be6\u60c55.jpg 750w, https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/Blending-Type-Polyester-Anti-static-Needle-Felt-\u8be6\u60c55-300x200.jpg 300w, https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/Blending-Type-Polyester-Anti-static-Needle-Felt-\u8be6\u60c55-600x400.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 750px) 100vw, 750px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<figcaption class=\"widget-image-caption wp-caption-text\">Blending Fiber Polyester Anti-static Needle Felt<\/figcaption>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/figure>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-e34d83d elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"e34d83d\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<figure class=\"wp-caption\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"750\" height=\"500\" src=\"https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/Cross-Line-Polyester-Anti-static-Needle-Felt-\u8be6\u60c56.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-3180\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/Cross-Line-Polyester-Anti-static-Needle-Felt-\u8be6\u60c56.jpg 750w, https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/Cross-Line-Polyester-Anti-static-Needle-Felt-\u8be6\u60c56-300x200.jpg 300w, https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/Cross-Line-Polyester-Anti-static-Needle-Felt-\u8be6\u60c56-600x400.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 750px) 100vw, 750px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<figcaption class=\"widget-image-caption wp-caption-text\">Cross Line Polyester Anti-static Needle Felt<\/figcaption>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/figure>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-8ac38f4 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"8ac38f4\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3>Advantages of Philite\u00ae Polyester Needle Felt<\/h3><ul><li>The pores of polyester needle punched filter felt are evenly distributed, with a porosity of 70%, which is twice that of woven filter cloth. High dust removal efficiency and low gas emission concentration.<\/li><li>The surface of the polyester needle-punched filter felt is hot-rolled, singed or coated, making it smooth and smooth, not easy to block or deform, easy to clean, and has a long service life.<\/li><li>Anti-static needle punched felt has the function of preventing corrosion and discharging electrostatic discharge generated by blast furnace gas and cement plant coal mill.<\/li><li>The capable of manufacturing 15,000 square meters per day (standard PE product). You can choose pure PE needle felt, PE blending needle felt , anti-static needle felt and water and oil proof needle felt. We also have SGS Qualifications of PE series product.<\/li><\/ul><hr \/><h3><strong><b>Application of Polyester Needle Felt<\/b><\/strong><\/h3><p>Some common applications include:<\/p><ul><li><strong>Dust Collection<\/strong>: Used in baghouse systems to capture dust and particulate matter in industries such as cement manufacturing, asphalt production, and woodworking.<\/li><li><strong>Air Pollution Control<\/strong>: Deployed in air filtration systems to reduce emissions from industrial processes and power generation facilities.<\/li><li><strong>Wastewater Treatment<\/strong>: Employed in filter presses and other filtration equipment to separate solids from liquids in municipal and industrial wastewater treatment plants.<\/li><li><strong>Chemical Processing<\/strong>: Used for filtering and separating chemicals and pharmaceutical products in manufacturing processes.<\/li><li><strong>Food and Beverage<\/strong>: Used in filtration systems for clarifying liquids, such as wine, beer, and fruit juices, to remove impurities and improve product quality.<\/li><li><strong>Metal Processing<\/strong>: Applied in metalworking industries to filter coolant fluids and remove metal fines and debris from cutting and grinding operations.<\/li><li><strong>Power Generation<\/strong>: Utilized in power plants for filtering ash and particulates from flue gases in coal-fired boilers and other combustion processes.<\/li><li><strong>Environmental Protection<\/strong>: Used in environmental remediation projects to filter contaminants from soil and groundwater.<\/li><li><strong>Pharmaceutical Industry<\/strong>: Applied in pharmaceutical manufacturing for sterile filtration and clarification of liquids and gases.<\/li><\/ul>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-7e627a2 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-child\" data-id=\"7e627a2\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-defa418 elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"defa418\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"750\" height=\"500\" src=\"https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/Coal-Filtration-\u8be6\u60c57.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-3181\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/Coal-Filtration-\u8be6\u60c57.jpg 750w, https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/Coal-Filtration-\u8be6\u60c57-300x200.jpg 300w, https:\/\/fi